{"title":"2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a game, a player throws a ball at a target. If they hit the target, then 7 points are added to their score. If they miss the target, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points are subtracted from their score. A player’s score begins at 0, and it is possible for a player to have a negative score.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c (page does not exist)\">2022 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018021628\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCompl